-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Ch2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"--tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \u002F .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; line-height: 1.6em; --tw-text-opacity: 1; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; text-align: center;\"\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"--tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \u002F .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px;\"\u003E\u003Cfont color=\"#1ead95\" face=\"PingFang SC, system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, Helvetica Neue, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\"\u003EReal-World Experimental Validation of GR-RL\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Ffont\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cfont color=\"#1ead95\" face=\"PingFang SC, system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, Helvetica Neue, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\"\u003EFrom a Doubled Success Rate to Emergent \"Error-Correction\" Intelligence\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Ffont\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\u003Cdiv data-page-id=\"Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnleshnibwu1gVAzASKbXRLc\"\u003EOn the dual-armed wheeled robot ByteMini-v2, the team conducted an end-to-end validation of GR-RL using the \"shoe-lacing\" task. This robot is equipped with a unique spherical wrist joint design, enabling flexible, human-like rotation, which gives it distinct advantages in highly dexterous, high-precise tasks.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqFHdqPnVoxKJmxvXQpcqubpnPf\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn7DaROfEo8s4vpiOuPDQKah\"\u003EThe team established rigorous experimental standards: A sparse reward function was employed, meaning the model receives a reward of 1 only upon reaching the terminal state where the shoelace is successfully threaded through the designated eyelet and placed back on the table, and receives 0 reward in all other scenarios. The model's observations are composed of RGB images from three views (including the head and wrists), proprioceptive states, and language instructions.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn7DaROfEo8s4vpiOuPDQKah\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Csection style=\"--tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \u002F .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ;\"\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\" style=\"--tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: 