d-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \u002F .5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin: 8px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: rgb(29, 29, 31); text-indent: 0em; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;isCut&quot;:false,&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;parentId&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;blockIds&quot;:[109,110,111,112,113],&quot;recordIds&quot;:[&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;,&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;,&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;,&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;,&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;],&quot;recordMap&quot;:{&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:null,&quot;revisions&quot;:null,&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;The GR-RL project validates a key insight: Real‑world reinforcement learning represents a viable technical pathway for long‑horizon, high‑precision manipulation of deformable objects. It demonstrates that, even without simulation, closed‑loop interaction can surpass the performance limits of imitation learning.&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+8o&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;text_indent&quot;:0}},&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:[],&quot;revisions&quot;:[],&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;nextNum&quot;:0,&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{}},&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;folded&quot;:false}},&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:null,&quot;revisions&quot;:null,&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;nextNum&quot;:1,&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;]}},&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+cf&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;However, during practical exploration, the team also identified limitations in the current approach: One of the major issues in the current pipeline is behavioral drift. Under sparse and noisy reward signals, the model's behavior may become unstable during online RL. This instability could stem from the limited capacity of the lightweight noise predictor, or from the inherent challenge of credit assignment within the large latent action space.&quot;}}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;text_indent&quot;:0}},&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:[],&quot;revisions&quot;:[],&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;nextNum&quot;:0,&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{}},&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;folded&quot;:false}},&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:null,&quot;revisions&quot;:null,&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;The team believes that reinforcement learning should extend beyond an isolated fine‑tuning step. Future progress may hinge on distilling RL experience—gained from real‑world closed‑loop interaction—back into VLA foundation models. Such a data feedback loop could ultimately yield a general‑purpose policy that combines high‑precision manipulation with robust generalization.&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+ae&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;text_indent&quot;:0}},&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;page&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:null,&quot;revisions&quot;:null,&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[&quot;YqU2dEKrfoC48GxAA3qc2FjUnZe&quot;,&quot;doxcnj8odth9AWNUqoPfG9bZVwg&quot;,&quot;QUVwdQ1ygobtV2xqm84cD8olnRe&quot;,&quot;doxcnisKjhZh5oDNKb7r7Fqp6nb&quot;,&quot;HwpFdqnz2oOUpcxbZLvc0iOpnFb&quot;,&quot;doxcnIh8nSEsI4UFo8OHZSo0qwc&quot;,&quot;BSVad1MxjoFGObxGjOFcnijYnBE&quot;,&quot;doxcnhuAnMRiCYqZaAzt28YeeDb&quot;,&quot;BgSQd4qbZoTTMTxVGl4cqvivnRg&quot;,&quot;doxcnsDFG5J7zjodwmhKfrZqgJg&quot;,&quot;DZP5djCDEoDlTVx8TPjcYhCpnCc&quot;,&quot;doxcnc74ZnvygEiKrS2PHQnRTsg&quot;,&quot;NECrdMX0coaJiOxmssZcfQgsnGg&quot;,&quot;Zm0BdYfFvoM0ZNxuRoacZ9ALnEb&quot;,&quot;doxcnwBDT4K7VnyhEtzWQRDBs8e&quot;,&quot;DSPJddm5Wovgc8xbOFEchK5DnSh&quot;,&quot;doxcnsFCqYlGrrFkGmywPX4fd8d&quot;,&quot;DLxzdYLiPo30iLx8XlXcolulnBg&quot;,&quot;GRlidg5wFoldvfxen9ecsWrknac&quot;,&quot;HUCAdYy3MoBzO4xAlYrcUxs8nfg&quot;,&quot;doxcnwiJCAIJV7C44un1TgkuOgf&quot;,&quot;X2UldMBMEoLI8hxHbILcoW3endg&quot;,&quot;R9HTdRfbToMoDWxAdBmco8i6nwd&quot;,&quot;doxcnBFc7SECtW5R01FhbNgvmXc&quot;,&quot;doxcnly5RxMIsCOTHzFZ3PQ60GX&quot;,&quot;doxcnYBfYRUzMs1IvEyYMh37Znc&quot;,&quot;FwGddZxS2oqnCOxrEh9cre2wnKh&quot;,&quot;doxcnCNmvtF1UdPexJuOpCfPmnN&quot;,&quot;U4LAdABUsoIMm1xTt6HchGDOnnf&quot;,&quot;doxcnH0F1lwWx2llJZvZ2KEukJc&quot;,&quot;EWfvdoyZroY2eDxAgZ8cs9Ionah&quot;,&quot;doxc