n7DaROfEo8s4vpiOuPDQKah&quot;,&quot;GvHRd9tnWokahNxKFMqcVgdSnve&quot;,&quot;doxcnT9clDITe9Mae9501WdA49f&quot;,&quot;XTzcdAek8ogusFxyRUycP459nsh&quot;,&quot;doxcnkmAqQ0ZpPVfh6CoyvoryYf&quot;,&quot;UhMtdTmSpoc8UKxJHLccBaCDnfc&quot;,&quot;doxcnzf8im2Trv7S7K6gi9F6x2e&quot;,&quot;doxcnR8TnH0Hea7UaubyTqEtPBh&quot;,&quot;doxcnkaThKvWq7IW78rse1ULNG8&quot;,&quot;L7uvdaQYloxEQaxaGrXcl1Bcnub&quot;,&quot;MLFwda8x8osjytxNGkqcC3NYnGg&quot;,&quot;Fq3ydqUb6oU83mxYlELcI3pLnGh&quot;,&quot;doxcnSrMGNik5jrKgtYTc9DQYvf&quot;,&quot;GUvndCYmLoy5zjxyGvcc1q95nkb&quot;,&quot;doxcn88LMPO7Jdg5ZhYnU86VxOc&quot;,&quot;H72zdY3Y7oZNwjxR2DKcLWnGn1g&quot;,&quot;AutIdXvoBoS3DXxNVGFcUXu6nae&quot;,&quot;UyX9dtAiiojOqExGbeOcnZKYntc&quot;,&quot;doxcnTw13X1Avu9mUgfWkGrYRAh&quot;,&quot;doxcnAh0MlHS1q749Nkkk99qdLf&quot;,&quot;doxcnJHCORGOUGWeMMUJ7nFEBIe&quot;,&quot;UhMcdkDfHoEURqxIyUCc157pnOh&quot;,&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;,&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;,&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;,&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;,&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;,&quot;W3bKd6Ch5oRC7lxky6Bcdz6lnsg&quot;,&quot;doxcnP0Q7bgb7ESWGDA08RZP8ue&quot;,&quot;WuMCdT4D4oxYILxJtUIcs0ZenMh&quot;,&quot;PohQdxEx7owXpoxopZJcFvKanEg&quot;,&quot;BtfEd7RxZog8pOxRhQxckguenff&quot;,&quot;U3CmdWoDvo1AEBxIJLQc6qXfnRc&quot;,&quot;QHiNdhU9ConnNRxPsIWcZ7uWnJb&quot;],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;nextNum&quot;:1,&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7444063051120132097&quot;]}},&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+4q&quot;},&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;Seed Research | GR-RL Released: A Breakthrough in High-Precision Manipulation for VLA Models, Applying Real-World Reinforcement Learning to Shoe Lacing for the First Time&quot;}}},&quot;align&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}},&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;:{&quot;level&quot;:1},&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;:{&quot;level&quot;:1},&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;:{&quot;level&quot;:1},&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;:{&quot;level&quot;:1},&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;:{&quot;level&quot;:1}},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;66cd7627-6f6e-482d-acc9-fcecf6e1b10a&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{},&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:false},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:109,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:312},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:110,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:0},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:111,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:447},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:112,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:0},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;IQSWdhtqBosdERxxgpQc637lnQc&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:113,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:374},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;doxcnPDTbTTYlAhMsHcNzHMx44g&quot;}],&quot;pasteFlag&quot;:&quot;a6934769-11bf-4c7c-a129-9ca4134d2a3c&quot;}\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\" class=\"lark-record-clipboard\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cdiv data-page-id=\"Rr07d9wHKog671x1ph0cLyfanIb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn9KwiYkKk05VccA7kDH9uAg\"\u003EThe GR-RL project validates a key insight: Real‑world reinforcement learning represents a viable technical pathway for long‑horizon, high‑precision manipulation of deformable objects. It demonstrates that, even without simulation, closed‑loop interaction can surpass the performance limits of imitation learning.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B4IsdhAC5oSxVWxxPgncRhHinCg\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp\"\u003EHowever, during practical exploration, the team also identified limitations in the current approach: One of the major issues in the current pipeline is behavioral drift. Under sparse and noisy reward signals, the model's behavior may become unstable during online RL. This instability could stem from the limited capacity of the lightweight noise predictor, or from the inherent challenge of credit assignment within the large latent action space.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"text-align:left\" class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnYd93Olnqn6RaxUsA88lSPp\"\u003EThe team believes that reinforcement learning should extend beyond an isolated fine‑tuning step. Future progress may hinge on distilling RL experience—gained from real‑world closed‑loop interactions—back into VLA foundation models. Such a data feedback loop could ultimately yield a general‑purpose policy that combines high‑precision manipulation with robust generalization.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","ContentZh":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\n  .markdown-body h1,\n  .markdown-body h2,\n  .markdown-body h3,\n  .markdown-body h4,\n  .markdown-body h5,\n  .markdown-body h6 {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-bottom: 0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .markdown-body \u003E p {\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  .markdown-body \u003E section {\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\u003C\u002Fstyle\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Csection style=\"\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.578px;\n    margin-left: 0px;\n    margin-right: 0px;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在 Scaling Law\n    的推动下，具身智能正迎来关键突破，基于海量数据预训练的视觉-语言-动作（VLA）模型已展现出不错的通用泛化能力。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E然而，当我们将机器人的应用场景从理想的实验室环境搬进复杂的家庭环境中，面对诸如“穿鞋带”这类看似琐碎，实则\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E要求高精度、高\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E鲁棒\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E、柔性物体操作\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E的任务时，现有的 SOTA 模型往往表现得力不从心。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E对人类而言，“穿鞋带”是肌肉记忆；但对机器人而言，这是操作领域最难的灵巧任务之一。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E为何拥有“通用大脑”的机器人，却依然做不好这件小事？\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E字节跳动 Seed 团队研究发现，症结在于主流模仿学习（Imitation\n    Learning）范式存在两大内生缺陷——人类演示数据的“次优性”以及训练与推理之间的“执行错位”\n    。为了突破这一瓶颈，团队并未依赖难以建模的\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E仿真学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E，而是选择探索一条更具挑战性的路径：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E真机\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E强化学习(\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EReal-world&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EReinforcement Learning)\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E基于此，字节跳动&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003ESeed\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E&nbsp;团队发布最新研究成果&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EGR-RL\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E，着力于拓展&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EVLA\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E&nbsp;模型在长时程精细灵巧操作方面的能力边界。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\u003Cimg style=\"width: 538.995px; height: 393.719px; margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio5aorw.jpeg\"\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cem\u003E\u003Cspan data-eleid=\"3\"\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003EGR-RL 以多阶段\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E实现穿鞋带\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fem\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EGR-RL\n    提出了一套从离线数据筛选到在线真机微调的强化学习框架，在业界首次实现“让机器人给整只鞋连续穿鞋带”。相较前作监督学习模型\n    GR-3，GR-RL 在穿鞋带任务上将成功率从 45.7% 提升至 83.3%，减少了近 70%\n    的失败情况。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n\u003Cvideo style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto; max-width: 80%;\" controls=\"\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio3uspd.mp4\"\u003E您的浏览器不支持视频播放。\u003C\u002Fvideo\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\n  \u003Cspan data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;SbX4djHPMoN8V7xj0yZcmGYjnBh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;GR-RL 提出了一套从离线数据筛选到在线真机微调的强化学习框架，在业界首次实现“让机器人给整只鞋连续穿鞋带”。相较前作监督学习模型 GR-3，GR-RL 在穿鞋带任务上将成功率从 45.7% 提升至 83.3%，减少了近 70% 的失败情况。&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+y*1+6*0*2+g*0+y*0*3+6*0+q&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7389819644754722819&quot;],&quot;1&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7424339991441850396&quot;],&quot;2&quot;:[&quot;comment-id-7576975112105102280&quot;,&quot;true&quot;],&quot;3&quot;:[&quot;comment-id-7577331747222867166&quot;,&quot;true&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:4}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:true,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;9493a67a-0a27-4294-8366-faffaa5f0f0e&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:22,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:122},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;PSEYdbcUPo0HEixNAzwcOylqnhc&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Ftext\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\"channels_iframe_wrp\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003Cmp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-url=\"https:\u002F\u002Ffindermp.video.qq.com\u002F251\u002F20304\u002Fstodownload?encfilekey=rjD5jyTuFrIpZ2ibE8T7YmwgiahniaXswqzfv8eMsyg3QsftvU5ASwiabZcjLyduIwNAaMMYlgLmhU4qiabwfzjsIdsZIQwobCfY1LFXBI2ahmS2jKkAyAzibaUA&amp;token=x5Y29zUxcibAGgbJMusqRJwq3KySOe0WialfGiaQlDiaVzQQxmKKuuiaPicaJuPftZE7264tfYiav2BzzAZoGVhoGcyyMHKiac1RyFUOt4yMR9r8bVu9WhWPOyMRslzURcSKCIbfxKtj60R57N8HBVeRwtlKOzibsPkUAgEEjdbwuZ6aErruFfAEuhc692PABBiboTick1O&amp;hy=SH&amp;idx=1&amp;m=&amp;scene=2&amp;uzid=1&amp;wxampicformat=503&amp;picformat=200\" data-headimgurl=\"http:\u002F\u002Fwx.qlogo.cn\u002Ffinderhead\u002FdH8QVxmk2IUxxwHD4vgf1JqZOEmKuYlFcXERRj8oZFjVHfhyHicQvOZPIfMjvicCyCU1ZpJ0Os4G0\u002F0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c5e78d11c1d6c60cee37b07720582dfe28a665dd0d3bce60dd395edd@finder\" data-nickname=\"字节跳动Seed\" data-desc=\"🤖还记得小时候学穿鞋带吗？对人类来说，是成长的必修课；但对机器人而言，却是操作领域最难的灵巧任务之一。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👀今天，字节跳动 Seed 团队正式发布 GR-RL 模型，在业界首次实现“让机器人给整只鞋连续穿鞋带”，拓展了 VLA 模型在长时程、精细灵巧操作方面的能力边界。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🚀为何 GR-RL 能挑战高精细的操作难题？这背后是一套从离线数据筛选到在线真机微调的强化学习框架。GR-RL 具备较强的鲁棒性，不仅穿鞋带成功率达 83.3%；还具备自动重试、主动调整场景、识别错位并纠偏的能力；也可应对不同颜色、尺寸和材质的鞋子。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;👉GR-RL 更多技术细节已公开，欢迎查阅项目主页：https:\u002F\u002Fseed.bytedance.com\u002Fgr_rl&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#字节seed #机器人 #强化学习 #具身智能 #robotics #字节跳动 #GR-RL\" data-nonceid=\"14164560072063492984\" data-authiconurl=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdldir1v6.qq.com\u002Fweixin\u002Fcheckresupdate\u002Ficons_filled_channels_authentication_enterprise_a2658032368245639e666fb11533a600.png\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1440\" data-type=\"video\" data-id=\"export\u002FUzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAl8cZph2OGwAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEpaBMFjFxctKOzNPgMIsgIu94_LlF6yTvSLV47ChJ\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fmp-common-videosnap\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E本文将深度解读 GR-RL\n    如何通过一套从经验中自主学习的多阶段训练方法，攻克柔性物体操作难题。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cblockquote style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cp style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n    \"\u003E\n    \u003Cstrong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px\"\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px\"\u003E论文链接：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003Cp style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n    \"\u003E\n    \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n        color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-weight: normal;\n      \"\u003Ehttps:\u002F\u002Farxiv.org\u002Fabs\u002F2512.01801\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003Cp style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n    \"\u003E\n    \u003Cstrong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px\"\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px\"\u003E项目主页：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n    \"\u003E\n    \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n        color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-weight: normal;\n      \"\u003Ehttps:\u002F\u002Fseed.bytedance.com\u002Fgr_rl\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fblockquote\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E&nbsp;从通用基座到精细操作\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E让 VLA 模型走向真正可用&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E预训练为 VLA\n    模型提供了通用的感知与决策能力，但这并不意味着它们能直接在特定应用场景中可靠地运行。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E为了验证这一边界，团队选择了“穿鞋带”作为试金石。这一任务集齐了机器人操作领域的三大挑战：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 24px 8px 16px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E柔性交互：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E鞋带形态随受力实时变化，难以预测；\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 16px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E极致精度：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E需达到毫米级控制精度才能准确将鞋带穿过鞋孔；\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 0px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E长时程鲁棒性：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E需在数分钟的连续操作中应对各类突发状况。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E团队发现，即便是拥有出色泛化能力的通用机器人模型\n    GR-3（基于机器人轨迹、人类演示数据及公开图文数据训练），在面对此类任务时也无法直接通过微调获得可用策略。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 16px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E为何主流的模仿学习在此失效？团队总结了两大核心技术难点：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 16px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E人类演示数据存在“次优片段”：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在极高精度的灵巧操作场景下，人类演示者会不自觉地放慢动作、出现犹豫，甚至多次中途失败再修正。如果直接进行模仿学习，模型会记住无效甚至错误的动作，导致策略不够果断和精准。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 0px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E训练与推理存在“执行错位”：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E为实现平滑的推理与控制，业界通常会对预测的动作块进行后处理，例如\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E时序集成（Temporal Ensembling） 、滚动时域控制（Receding Horizon\n        Control）\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E等。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E这些优化方法虽保证了动作的平滑性，但也导致\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E模型训练\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E时学习的动作\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E（Predicted Action）\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E与推理时执行的动作\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E（Final Action）出现\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E不对齐。在毫米级精度操作中，这种错误切断了动作与环境反馈的真实因果链条，导致任务失败。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E为了攻克 VLA\n    精细操作的瓶颈，我们需要一套新方法：既能从质量良莠不齐的演示数据中抽取出高质量的行为，又能让模型在环境中尝试和练习，利用自身经验数据使模型真正适应部署的环境。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E&nbsp;离线 + 在线多阶段强化\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E让机器人在试错中持续学习&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E针对前述提到的数据次优性与执行错误难题，Seed\n    团队提出适用于长时程、高精度灵巧操作的 GR-RL 模型。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在原有的&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EVLA\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E&nbsp;基础上，GR-RL 引入了一个额外的\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E判别器\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E网络（Critic\n    Transformer），用于衡量机器人动作的质量，对动作序列中每个时刻的动作都进行一次打分。具体而言，GR-RL\n    采用了值分布\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E，将判别器输出假设为一个离散概率分布，以更\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E鲁棒\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E地捕捉真实环境中存在的噪声。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\u003Cimg style=\"width: 80%;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio5cvn1.jpeg\"\u003E\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003EGR-RL 的模型架构\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E基于此架构，GR-RL 设计了一套\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E从经验中筛选\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E、\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在实践中进化\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E的多阶段训练框架。该框架包含三个核心环节：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal\"\u003E离线\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal\"\u003E、\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal\"\u003E数据增强\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: normal\"\u003E以及在线强化学习。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch4 style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E离线阶段：基于\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E评估模型对\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E数据“去伪存真”\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E人类演示数据中混杂着次优片段，GR-RL 的第一步是利用离线\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E训练上述的\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E判别器\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E网络（即 Critic 价值评估模型），让模型先学会“什么是错误的动作”。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 24px 8px 0px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E构造“反事实”负样本：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E由于遥操作收集到的轨迹大多是成功的，缺乏负样本，因此团队在每条轨迹中标记开始重试的关键帧，构造出更多失败轨迹：假设一条成功的\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E原始轨迹为\u003Cimg data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLv8v8Cw9SYumOHpkHOz9Qib8IJ61t1evo6ibZy1PtL40X9JuAaRVQzARRg\u002F640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0740740740740742\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"54\" style=\"height: 26px;display:inline-block;\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100009158\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002Fmio32yep.jpg\"\u003E，团队在其中标记出开始重试的关键帧\u003Cimg data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLvk6fAN6jmo3yEAIhXFDC3l5GMF6XtvnkhdJO0mIQZH13A8dTLzgf3dQ\u002F640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.29292929292929293\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"198\" style=\"display:inline-block;height: 26px;\" type=\"block\" data-croporisrc=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLvhdK5ScvibwHoicWqCibadT1ibgPqjRltvj6W6YaicKjObib2IHkx5E0OAibNA\u002F0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropx2=\"198\" data-cropy2=\"58.03448275862069\" data-imgfileid=\"100009156\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002Fmio32yig.jpg\"\u003E，除原始成功轨迹外，系统将截取重试前的片段\u003Cimg data-src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLvS69wZjDFwSaw5YKE5Nj1lrCwO40c8MLPG0MshvWfStUc28O44icnRIg\u002F640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.3185840707964602\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"226\" style=\"display:inline-block;height: 32px;\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100009159\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002Fmio32z29.jpg\"\u003E并将其标记为失败轨迹。这种方法在不增加额外采集成本的情况下，大幅扩充了负样本空间。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E训练价值\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E判别器\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在混合了成功与失败的轨迹集上，团队利用时序差分学习（TD\n        Learning）训练\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E&nbsp;Critic&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E价值评估模型。下图展示了评估模型在一条采集轨迹上的预测情况：当操作员失误导致鞋带从孔中滑出时，Critic\n        预测值（Q-value）骤降；而当操作员第二次尝试并成功穿孔时，预测值会马上恢复并稳定上升。基于此，团队剔除了\n        Q\n        值突降的低价值片段，仅保留高质量数据用于监督学习，从而获得了更纯粹的基础策略。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 24px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\u003Cimg style=\"width: 80%;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio5d489.jpeg\"\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E评估模型评判采集轨迹片段的好坏\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch4 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-indent: 0em;\n    \"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E数据增强：物理“对称”强化泛化理解\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 0px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E团队利用双臂协作任务的镜像对称性，设计了全方位的数据增强策略：对图像、本体状态、动作轨迹和语言指令进行左右镜像翻转。这不仅将数据量翻倍，更提升了模型对空间关系的泛化理解。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Ch4 style=\"\n    margin: 24px 8px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E在线阶段：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E导向\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cspan textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"\u003E进行精细训练\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh4\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E团队发现，模型必须把系统级优化都当成强化学习环境的一部分，通过闭环在线交互进行探索与自我优化，这一点对于精细操作至关重要。团队采用导向强化学习（steering\n    RL）方法微调 flow\n    模型的去噪过程，把机器人动作导向评估模型的高回报区域。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cs\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fs\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E隐空间\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E探索\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E：\n        由于完成任务需要毫米级的精度控制，使用在原始动作空间如手腕或关节位置添加随机噪声的常规方法，几乎无法探索出成功轨迹。团队转而在隐空间中进行结构化探索，通过调整流模型策略的输入噪声，让策略预测出不一样的轨迹。\n        团队在 VLM 骨干网络后引入了一个仅 51.5M 参数的噪声预测器，\n        它通过调整流模型的输入噪声，引导生成的轨迹向评估模型的高分区域偏移。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E双缓冲池策略\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E：\n        为了平衡样本效率与分布偏移，团队维护了两个缓冲池，其中异策略缓冲池存储历史权重生成的交互数据，用于\n        Critic\n        预热；同策略缓冲池仅存储最近两个版本模型生成的轨迹。训练时，系统从两个池中\n        1:1\n        均匀采样。这种策略既保证了样本利用率，又避免了因模型快速更新导致的分布偏移，确保在线微调稳健高效。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E&nbsp;GR-RL 真机实验验证\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Ch2 style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E从成功率翻倍到涌现“纠错”智能&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在双臂轮式机器人 ByteMini-v2 上，团队基于“穿鞋带”任务对 GR-RL\n    进行了全流程验证。该机器人配备了独特的球形腕部关节设计，能够像人类手腕一样灵活转动，在精细灵巧任务中独具优势。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E团队设计了严格的实验标准：采用稀疏奖励函数，即只有在鞋带成功穿过\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E指定\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E的孔并放回桌面这一最终状态，模型才能获得 1 分奖励，其他情况下均为 0\n    分。对模型的观测，包括头部与腕部三个视角的 RGB\n    图像、机器人本体状态信息以及语言指令。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\u003Cimg style=\"width:80%;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio5deqa.jpeg\"\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003EByteMini-v2 机器人\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\n  \u003Cspan data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;SbX4djHPMoN8V7xj0yZcmGYjnBh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;ByteMini-v2 机器人&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0*1+f&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7389819644754722819&quot;],&quot;1&quot;:[&quot;textHighlight&quot;,&quot;rgb(143,149,158)&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:2}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:true,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;c54efb42-cbc2-4177-b781-eca27df9ade4&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:89,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:15},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;doxcnsSZHLTrsP5LdwC13RC7Ozh&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Ftext\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E实验结果表明，纯模仿学习基线（GR-3）的成功率仅为\n    45.7%，难以应对精细操作。GR-RL\n    通过多阶段训练框架实现了性能的阶梯式跨越，三个核心组件都对成功率的提升有重要贡献：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E数据过滤：剔除次优数据后，离线数据过滤将成功率提升至 61.6%；\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E数据增强：引入镜像数据扩充，成功率可提升至 72.7%；\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n  \u003Cli\u003E\n    \u003Cp style=\"\n        margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n        outline: 0px;\n        font-family:\n          &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n          system-ui,\n          -apple-system,\n          &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n          &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n          &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n          &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n          Arial,\n          sans-serif;\n        letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n        background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n        line-height: 1.75em;\n        text-indent: 0em;\n      \"\u003E\n      \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在线\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E强化学习\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E：\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E以增强后的离线学习模型作为在线强化学习的起点，经过约 150\n        条轨迹的真机闭环探索与修正，GR-RL 的成功率最终上升至 83.3%。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n    \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fli\u003E\n\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\u003Cspan data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Frecord\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\u003Cimg style=\"width:80%;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio5dm4s.jpg\"\u003E\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cblockquote\u003E\n  \u003Cp style=\"margin: 0px 8px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: left\"\u003E\n    \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E左图：多阶段训练实现阶梯式成功率提升；\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n  \u003Cp style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: left\"\u003E\n    \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E右图：在线强化学习的成功率变化曲线\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n  \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fblockquote\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在实验中，团队观察到，引入强化学习后的 GR-RL\n    涌现出了类似人类的纠错智能。模型应对失误情况时能稳健恢复：例如当鞋带在抓取、穿孔环节意外滑落时，模型并未卡死，而是自发重试；在初始摆放位置比较困难（如鞋带被压住）时，模型能主动将场景调整到自己更熟悉的状态，再接着完成任务。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cvideo controls=\"\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio3shml.mp4\" style=\"max-width: 80%; height: auto; display:block; margin: 0 auto;\"\u003E您的浏览器不支持视频播放。\u003C\u002Fvideo\u003E\u003Csection style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E面对失误情况，GR-RL 能自发重试\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\u003Cvideo controls=\"\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F47w9omio3tedd.mp4\" style=\"max-width: 80%; height: auto; display:block; margin: 0 auto;\"\u003E您的浏览器不支持视频播放。\u003C\u002Fvideo\u003E\u003Csection style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-align: center; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 8px 24px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 14px\"\u003E摆放位置别扭时，GR-RL 会主动调整\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\n  \u003Cspan data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;SbX4djHPMoN8V7xj0yZcmGYjnBh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;初始摆放位置别扭时，GR-RL 会主动调整&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0*1+l&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7389819644754722819&quot;],&quot;1&quot;:[&quot;textHighlight&quot;,&quot;rgb(143,149,158)&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:2}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:true,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;f93100d5-9b66-460c-84e0-975903c8fa73&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:124,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:21},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;KtUAdsTlJoiI6TxKHfacppefnJb&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Ftext\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E这种“感知-决策-修正”的闭环能力，证明了模型真正理解任务的物理逻辑，而非单纯记忆轨迹。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.6em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      color: rgb(30, 173, 149);\n    \"\u003E&nbsp;总结与展望&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection\u003E\n  \u003Cspan data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;SbX4djHPMoN8V7xj0yZcmGYjnBh&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;总结与展望&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0+5&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;7389819644754722819&quot;]},&quot;nextNum&quot;:1}},&quot;type&quot;:&quot;heading2&quot;,&quot;referenceRecordMap&quot;:{},&quot;extra&quot;:{&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;saas&quot;,&quot;isEqualBlockSelection&quot;:true,&quot;pasteRandomId&quot;:&quot;8d63283c-d537-4a46-9b23-470685448e3a&quot;,&quot;mention_page_title&quot;:{},&quot;external_mention_url&quot;:{}},&quot;isKeepQuoteContainer&quot;:false,&quot;isFromCode&quot;:false,&quot;selection&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:104,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;selection&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:0,&quot;end&quot;:5},&quot;recordId&quot;:&quot;doxcnYsucIpQq5JouFLRnlaI025&quot;}],&quot;payloadMap&quot;:{},&quot;isCut&quot;:false}\" data-lark-record-format=\"docx\u002Ftext\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003EGR-RL\n    的工作验证了一件事：对于长时程、极高精度的柔性物体操作，真机强化学习是一条行之有效的技术路径。它让我们在无法依赖仿真的情况下，依然能通过闭环交互突破模仿学习的性能天花板。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"\n    margin: 8px 8px 24px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.544px;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    text-indent: 0em;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E但在实际探索中，团队也发现目前的方案仍存在局限性：当前流程的主要问题之一是行为偏移。在稀疏且含噪声的奖励信号下，\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E模型\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 0em\"\u003E在在线强化学习阶段的行为可能出现不稳定。这可能源于轻量级噪声预测器的容量有限，也可能是在庞大的隐空间动作空间中，信用分配（Credit\n    Assignment）本身具有挑战性。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px\"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      font-family:\n        &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n        system-ui,\n        -apple-system,\n        &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n        &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n        &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n        &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n        &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n        Arial,\n        sans-serif;\n      background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-indent: 0em;\n    \"\u003E团队认为，强化学习不应是一个孤立的微调环节。未来的关键可能在于将真机闭环交互中获得的\n    RL 经验，蒸馏回基础 VLA 模型中。通过这种\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      font-family:\n        &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n        system-ui,\n        -apple-system,\n        &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n        &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n        &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n        &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n        &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n        Arial,\n        sans-serif;\n      background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n      line-height: 1.75em;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      text-indent: 0em;\n    \"\u003E数据反哺，我们有望构建出兼具高精度操作性能与强大泛化能力的通用策略。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan leaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n    margin-left: 0px;\n    margin-right: 0px;\n  \" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"\n    letter-spacing: 0.578px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"\n    margin-bottom: 0px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.578px;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    outline: 0px;\n    font-family:\n      &quot;PingFang SC&quot;,\n      system-ui,\n      -apple-system,\n      &quot;system-ui&quot;,\n      &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,\n      &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,\n      &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,\n      Arial,\n      sans-serif;\n    background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.75em;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  \"\u003E\n  \u003Cspan style=\"\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      vertical-align: bottom;\n      user-select: none;\n      width: 677px;\n    \"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n      outline: 0px;\n      vertical-align: bottom;\n      user-select: none;\n      width: 677px;\n    \"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1em\"\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmp.weixin.qq.com\u002Fs?__biz=MzkzMDY5MzYxNg==&amp;mid=2247492258&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=86c3e018095162f7123c47b23902068e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" imgurl=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLvEkUDC4W4Hg7ELsObhtJryvBvHWSWEq4IGBNUgic5VXrmeCeoV0Nph8Q\u002F640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" linktype=\"image\" tab=\"innerlink\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" data-linktype=\"1\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"width: 100%\" class=\"js_jump_icon h5_image_link\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px\"\u003E\n  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmp.weixin.qq.com\u002Fs?__biz=MzkzMDY5MzYxNg==&amp;mid=2247492792&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c8db8f4ab5d6bb3e1d4f4751761c8be7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" imgurl=\"https:\u002F\u002Fmmbiz.qpic.cn\u002Fsz_mmbiz_jpg\u002FIrH3BAPESujJM2wksA6ibf2yI7a1otWLvV62Pwaiad1bIHuiap3rE13J9YbiayDHomSELP0UZOhicYoeUVVCq4mp4xA\u002F640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" linktype=\"image\" tab=\"innerlink\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" data-linktype=\"1\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"width: 100%\" class=\"js_jump_icon h5_image_link\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Csection style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1em\" nodeleaf=\"\"\u003E\n  \n\u003C\u002Fsection\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\"display: none\"\u003E\u003Cmp-style-type data-value=\"3\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fmp-style-type\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E"}}}},"errors":null}</script></body></html>